      "writtenOn": "2023-11-21T13:01:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure I understand this well – there can be multiple VPNs active on a device at any time (just non on the same user), and this kind of sounds like there can only be one. I expect you mean this is the only interface of the VPN ? If so how about `The VPN has only one interface, and only this interface has this address` ? Or, if it\u0027s guaranteed that VPNs have only one interface, `Only the VPN interface has this address (VPNs can only have one interface)`",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8796,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 8796,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "a1750f0df0ccc0020d7ed3026a2c256b3c48e8b2",
