        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-21T13:01:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this method is more expensive than it should, especially when there is no VPN. You could do a lot less work on average by gathering the addresses first, e.g.\n\n    Map\u003c\u003e addresses \u003d null;\n    for (mNetworkAgentInfos) {\n      if (!VPN) continue\n      if (null \u003d\u003d addresses) addresses \u003d new ArrayMap\u003c\u003e();\n      for (agent.lp.getAllAddresses) {\n        if (!address.isLinkLocal) addresses.add(address, iface)\n      }\n    }\n    if (null \u003d\u003d addresses) return\n    for (mNetworkAgentInfos) {\n      if (agent.equals(nai)) continue\n      for (agent.getAllAddresses) addresses.remove(address)\n    }",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8802,
        "startChar": 43,
        "endLine": 8802,
        "endChar": 70
      },
      "revId": "a1750f0df0ccc0020d7ed3026a2c256b3c48e8b2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
